      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53562550092579/huge/e7bc6343f5f5b8cd26bd8b13939769f8296fea45.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 10 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Pharmacy Orientation Week welcomes the Class of 2030 to the Howard University College of Pharmacy community. Throughout the week, students will learn about the PharmD curriculum, academic expectations, student resources, and professional standards essential to their success. Interactive sessions and networking opportunities will help students build meaningful connections with faculty, staff, student leaders, and classmates. By the end of the week, students will be prepared to begin their pharmacy journey with confidence, purpose, and Bison pride.</p>

