      <title>College of Nursing and Allied Health Science -  DIVISION OF NURSING ONLY   at SOE Auditorium</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53612742771223/huge/2c0fde9d71245f243fca3afce5b768a298790e70.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 10 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Howard University's Division of Nursing has a proud legacy of preparing compassionate, innovative, and highly skilled nurse leaders who are committed to advancing health equity and transforming healthcare locally, nationally, and globally. </p>

<p> </p>

<p>Join us to meet the Division of Nursing leadership, faculty, staff, and students as we welcome you to the Howard nursing community. Learn about the many academic, clinical, leadership, research, service, and professional development opportunities available to you as a nursing student. </p>

<p> </p>

<p>Discover what it takes to succeed in the program, connect with your peers, and begin building the foundation for a rewarding career in nursing.  </p>

<p> </p>

<p>Attire - Business Casual </p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/college-of-nursing-and-allied-health-science-division-of-nursingonly">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A College of Nursing and Allied Health Science -%E2%80%AF%E2%80%AFDIVISION OF NURSING%E2%80%AFONLY%E2%80%AF &amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Aug 10%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AHoward University%27s Division of Nursing has a proud legacy of preparing compassionate%2C innovative%2C and highly skilled nurse leaders who are committed to advancing health equity and transforming healthcare locally%2C nationally%2C and globally. %0A%0A %0A%0AJoin us to meet the Division of Nursing leadership%2C faculty%2C staff%2C and students as we welcome you to the Howard nursing community. Learn about the many academic%2C clinical%2C leadership%2C research%2C service%2C and professional development opportunities available to you as a nursing student. %0A%0A %0A%0ADiscover what it takes to succeed in the program%2C connect with your peers%2C and begin building the foundation for a rewarding career in nursing.  %0A%0A %0A%0AAttire - Business Casual%E2%80%AF%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2Fcollege-of-nursing-and-allied-health-science-division-of-nursingonly%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
